Missing labels return as physical layers and pull results into different grid cells.

q0044
00:04:56.494 --> 00:05:05.218
AND and inversion nodes form a small exact dependency cone whose fanout remains visible throughout the lesson.

q0045
00:05:05.218 --> 00:05:11.510
Holding that element fixed lets this episode isolate task/boundary decision grid.

q0046
